notes.content:
The new update of Scaper Dash brought with it not a lot of different content, namely:
- New music at the beginning and at the end of the game;
- New background at the beginning and at the end of the game;
-A new font added only to level 1, at the beginning and at the end of the game (please write how you like this font);
- Changed level 13 and 14;
- Fixed some bugs and bugs that could interfere with the gameplay;
- Announcement of new levels;
-Some other changes;
- And... Above all... a blank for the plot!

Well, in general, this update did not bring a lot of diverse content to the game, rather it is a bug fix mixed with some changes. In general, write to us how you like the update, as well as offer us your ideas, and perhaps they will be able to get into the game itself.
